{"availability":"available","full":"emollick/annals-kingdom","name":"annals-kingdom","description":"A living medieval kingdom in a single HTML file - procedural worldgen, economy, dynasties, wars, dragons, and a chronicle that writes itself","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":52,"forks":14,"created":"2026-07-08T14:20:48Z","updated":"2026-07-08T14:28:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://annals-kingdom.netlify.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://annals-kingdom.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:33.334Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:33.334Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:33.334Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T21:08:33.334Z","stars":52,"forks":14}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A procedurally generated medieval realm that lives on its own — harvests and plagues, dynasties and civil wars, bandits, omens, and a dragon asleep on its hoard — while its chronicle writes itself in the margin. Watch it like a nature documentary, or reach in and turn the dials of fate.","Everything is one HTML file. No build step, no backend, no saves — the entire kingdom regenerates deterministically from a seed in the URL hash, so a link is a world: share #s=your-seed-here and the recipient forges the exact same realm, down to the last shepherd."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emollick/annals-kingdom/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8e6ad61677dd73376e3ec46a59e2a50baec364d9b4bc6fa2ac77edd333d3946b","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:33.465Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T21:08:33.465Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A procedurally generated medieval realm that lives on its own — harvests and plagues, dynasties and civil wars, bandits, omens, and a dragon asleep on its hoard — while its chronicle writes itself in the margin. Watch it like a nature documentary, or reach in and turn the dials of fate.","sourceUrl":"https://githu